# :/ (colonSolidus)

Where supported `:/` is displayed as ⧸.

The name of this token is `colonSolidus`.

* * *

See also: Block

Guides: Arity Notation, Arity Syntax

Unicode:
U+00B0 ⧸ Big Solidus,
U+02080 ₀ Subscript Zero,
U+02081 ₁ Subscript One,
U+02082 ₂ Subscript Two,
U+02083 ₃ Subscript Three

Categories: Syntax
